  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi></math> be twice differentiable functions on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> such that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p>Then which of the following is NOT true ?</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "4cQeL",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "QFByU",
      "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>8</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dmuIM",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "aq5dY",
      "text": "There exists <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfenced></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given functions are:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>By integrating&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>, we get<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Again by integrating, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></math></p><p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></math>:</p><p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo></math></p><p>So, this option is true.</p><p>Option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;for all values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>.</p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>So, this option is NOT true.</p><p>Option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>always</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>true</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>So,&nbsp;If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>So, this option is true.</p><p>Option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>D</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Here, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ve</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ve</mi></math></p><p>So, there exists <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> such that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>So, this option is true.</p>",
